%% Extension lifecycle state machine — see docs/07-extension-engine.md §7.2
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> discovered
    discovered --> validated: manifest schema-checked
    validated --> rejected: permission check failed
    validated --> installed: dependencies resolved, migrations applied
    installed --> enabled: hooks registered, routes mounted
    enabled --> disabled: admin disable / circuit breaker trip
    disabled --> enabled: admin re-enable
    disabled --> uninstalled: admin uninstall
    rejected --> [*]
    uninstalled --> [*]
